Then we can plug back in the weekly pack procedures (already written earlier)

Important: action_id codes may vary

If your “Drop” or “Login failed” events are not showing, that means the audit action groups enabled in the audit spec differ.
We can quickly confirm by running:

SELECT TOP 50 action_id, COUNT(*) cnt
FROM dbo.v_Audit_All
WHERE event_time > DATEADD(DAY,-7,SYSUTCDATETIME())
GROUP BY action_id
ORDER BY cnt DESC;


Then we map the correct action_id values.


